Sharing the bulkier heavy-duty chassis design of Mark XXIV ("Tank") and Mark XVII ("Heartbreaker"), "Peacemaker" is clad in a bright orange and dark silver armor paint scheme. Tony equipped the suit with non-lethal sonic disorienting speakers, powerful flash-bang emitters, and high-intensity acoustic emitters to neutralize crowds without causing permanent harm.

In Iron Man 3, Mark XXXVI deploys with the Iron Legion during the House Party Protocol at the Norco oil rig, engaging Extremis soldiers in heavy frontline combat before being destroyed in the final "Clean Slate" detonation order.
